PPS Reset Features:
  * Synchronize device time to 0 at next PPS edge
  * Provides common time reference for all streams
  * Essential for multi-USRP or precise timing applications
  * Timestamps in output files are relative to PPS reset
  * Supports verification of successful PPS reset

Multi-Stream Features:
  * Capture from multiple DDC blocks simultaneously
  * Synchronized stream start for time-aligned captures
  * Per-stream statistics and monitoring
  * Separate or combined output files with stream headers
  * Multi-threaded capture with one thread per stream
  * Real-time progress monitoring during capture

File Format Features:
  * Version 4 CHDR format with PPS reset metadata
  * Per-stream headers in multi-stream files
  * Comprehensive analysis with PPS-relative timestamps

